  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Producers, Consumers and Civil Society for Greater Food Sovereignty in Lebanon &#x2013; Phase III</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This is the third phase of the project &#x2018;Producers, Consumers and Civil Society for Greater Food Sovereignty in Lebanon&#x2019;, which began in 2022 with funding from CAFOD. This project will contribute to food sovereignty by supporting 75 farmers through technical support on agroecology, peer-to-peer farmer exchanges and training on agroecology. The project will also continue to build on the successes of previous phases, working with 5 agri-food groups to increase capacities and collaboration through provision of capacity strengthening activities which will support organizational procedures, coordination and technical development.</narrative>
  </description>
